      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "네! <color=#F7BE45>선행</color>, <color=#F7BE45>은혜</color>, <color=#F7BE45>행복</color>. 다양한 의미가 담긴 드루이드의 말이죠.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "<color=#F7BE45>善行</color>、<color=#F7BE45>恩恵</color>、<color=#F7BE45>幸福</color>。色んな意味が込められた、ドルイドの言葉です！",
